<title>ARGENTINA: ARGENTINA SETS $6.6 MILLION IN OVERNIGHT REPOS.</title>
<headline>ARGENTINA SETS $6.6 MILLION IN OVERNIGHT REPOS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Wednesday it allocated $6.6 million in overnight repurchase agreements.</p>
<p>Call money rose to 6.95 percent from 6.90 percent at the close Tuesday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar was flat at 0.99981 peso from Tuesday.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
